    "text_full": "Solutions\nTools\nIntegrations\nResources\nPricing\nGet a demo\nLogin\nRegister\nLOOKING FOR A SELLERAMP SAS ALTERNATIVE?\nSellerAmp Alternative\n\nSeller Assistant is a powerful alternative to SellerAmp SAS. This all-in-one product-sourcing software offers 20+ tools to quickly find profitable and low-risk deals. Get effective solutions for automated wholesale price list scanning, brand and competitor analysis alongside comprehensive tools for in-depth product research.\n\nStart 14-day free trial\nLET'S COMPARE\nSeller Assistant vs SellerAmp SAS\n\nKey features comparison\n\nSeller Assistant\nSellerAmp SAS\nFEATURES\nAutomated Bulk Product Sourcing\n\nAdvanced tools for researching multiple products at once\n\nSeller Assistant integrates a wide range of essential tools for Amazon sellers, including Price List Analyzer, Brand Analyzer, Seller Spy, and Bulk Restriction Checker. These, along with the Seller Assistant Extension, IP Alert, and built-in VPN, ensure that sellers can efficiently find, analyze, and source profitable deals.\n\n‍SellerAmp doesn't have bulk sourcing tools.\n\nPrice List Analyzer\n\nScans wholesale product lists for profitable deals\n\nSeller Assistant's Price List Analyzer automates the evaluation of bulk wholesale lists, helping sellers identify profitable deals while flagging potential risks. It enriches product data with detailed metrics and allows sellers to apply advanced filters for more efficient sourcing.\n\n‍SellerAmp doesn't have bulk list scanning feature.\n\nBrand Analyzer\n\nEvaluates brand profitability and competition\n\n‍Seller Assistant's Brand Analyzer estimates brand's product count, potential revenue, competition levels, and review/rating quality.\n\n‍SellerAmp does not have a Brand Analyzer.\n\nBulk Restriction Checker\n\nChecks Amazon product restrictions in bulk\n\nSeller Assistant's Bulk Restriction Checker verifies product selling eligibility in bulk, saving time on manual checks.\n\nSellerAmp doesn't have bulk restriction checking.\n\nSeller Spy\n\nHelps identify competitor best-sellers to sell the same\n\nSeller Assistant's Seller Spy helps sellers expand their inventory based on competitor trends by selling best-sellers their competitors sell and adjust their own pricing strategies. This feature enables tracking their competitor's activities, including:\n✔ New and removed products\n✔ Pricing adjustments\n✔ Best-selling products\n\n‍SellerAmp doesn't have it.\n\nProduct View\n\nDisplays key product details directly on Amazon pages\n\nSeller Assistant Extension provides 4 powerful widgets, making product research more efficient and organized. Product View provides key product metrics, FBM & FBA Calculator, Offers, Variation Viewer, Alerts, Sales Estimator, Stock Checker, Notes, Restriction Checker, and search links to Google, eBay, Alibaba, and more.\n\n‍SellerAmp does not have dedicated product view, appears as web app or a side panel. Search links to Google and eBay only.\n\nSide Panel View\n\nAllows quick research on supplier websites\n\nNative Seller Assistant's Side Panel View works on any website, displaying product data, alerts, offers, variations, calculator, and more.\n\n‍SellerAmp's Side Panel View is an overlay linked to the source page. No sales tax calculations.\n\nQuick View\n\nHelps filter out bad/risky deals on search pages\n\nSeller Assistant's Quick View provides fast product research by showing BSR, competition level, Amazon Buy Box presence, IP alerts, and selling restriction, enables sellers to quickly filter out unsuitable products directly from Amazon search pages.\n\n‍SellerAmp doesn't have Quick View widget.\n\nStorefront Widget\n\nResearch competitors' storefronts for best-selling products\n\nSeller Assistant's Storefront Widget offers Amazon competitor storefront summary (brands, categories, ASIN count) and product-by-product data.\n\n‍SellerAmp's Storefront Search feature allows sellers to view competitor storefronts, giving insight into their top-selling products, brands, and categories.\n\nMobile Barcode Scanning App\n\nApp to scan and research products on the go\n\nSeller Assistant doesn't have mobile app for retail arbitrage scanning.\n\n‍SellerAmp has mobile app for scanning product barcodes (UPC/EAN) and analyzing products while sourcing in stores.\n\nIP Alerts and Restriction Warnings\n\nAllows users to easily identify and avoid risky Amazon products and brands with intellectual property issues\n\nSeller Assistant's IP Alert Extension is a unique tool that allows users to easily identify and avoid risky Amazon products and brands with intellectual property issues. Seller Assistant's exclusive database of Amazon product policy violations provides immediate updates on the type and date of each violation, and helps you to avoid high-risk products. Also Seller Assistant has Restriction Checker to identify gated products.\n‍\nSellerAmp offers IP and product restriction warnings but lacks Amazon policy violation details. Sometimes shows IP alerts incorrectly.\n\nVPN Access\n\nSecure browsing for product research\n\nVPN by Seller Assistant is a Chrome extension created specifically for Amazon sellers. It offers safe and unrestricted access to all websites, retailers, and online resources, no matter restrictions or blocks. VPN extension is integrated with Seller Assistant product sourcing software and helps sellers to perform advanced product research, overcome geo-restrictions, and protect their privacy without the need to spend money or install additional VPN tools.\n\n‍SellerAmp doesn't have built-in VPN.\n\nSales Estimator\n\nEstimates product demand based on BSR\n\nSeller Assistant's Sales Estimator provides monthly sales volume estimates.\n\n‍SellerAmp provides estimated sales and estimated time to sale.\n\nVariation Viewer\n\nIdentifies best-selling product variations\n\nSeller Assistant's Variation Viewer lets you see all product variations and the percentage of reviews per variation. Displays rating share to determine the most popular variations.\n\n‍SellerAmp has similar feature but slightly more complex to navigate. Displays a pie chart with variation review %.\n\nStock Checker\n\nMonitors competitor inventory levels\n\nStock Checker shows FBA & FBM seller stock availability.\n‍Both Seller Assistant and SellerAmp allow you to easily do so.\n\nGoogle Sheets Export\n\nSaves research data to Google Sheets\n\nExporting your analysis results to Google Sheets in one click allows saving and quickly processing your data in a convenient format.\n‍Both Seller Assistant and SellerAmp allow you to easily do so.\n\nTeamwork\n\nSolutions for secure work of your employees and virtual assistants\n\nSeller Assistant offers Virtual Assistant Accounts and teamwork features with secure seller account access.\n\n‍SellerAmp doesn't have specific team collaboration or VA features.\n\nAPI Integration\n\nConnects to third-party tools via API\n\nSeller Assistant has API integration with 1,000+ API requests per month (expandable).\n\n‍SellerAmp has no API access.\n\nPartner Integrations\n\nConnects with external services\n\nSeller Assistant has integrations with Zapier and Make (Airtable, Google Sheets, Notion, Amazon Seller Central).\n\n‍SellerAmp has integrations with BQool, Seller Toolkit, Arbitrage Hero, Google Sheets.\n\nTutorials & Support\n\nCustomer assistance and guides\n\nSeller Assistant has human support, knowledge base, how-to videos.\n‍SellerAmp provides How-to videos only.\n\nPricing\nStarting at $13.33/month ($159.99/year)\nStarting at $19.95/month\nTRY NOW\nAdvanced Alternative to SellerAmp SAS\n\nSeller Assistant provides an all-in-one product sourcing solution, including bulk sourcing automation, advanced competitor analysis, built-in VPN, and team collaboration tools, making it ideal for wholesale and online arbitrage sellers, and dropshippers.\n\nTry for free\n\nNot sure which plan fits your sourcing workflow? Chat with our team — we're happy to help.\n\nNAVIGATION\nHome\nPricing\nDownload\nSOLUTIONS\nOnline Arbitrage\nWholesale\nDropshipping\nAgencies\nPRODUCTS\nPrice List Analyzer\nLister\nPurchase Orders\nSuppliers\nWarehouses\nSeller Assistant Extension\nIP-Alert by Seller Assistant\nVPN by Seller Assistant\nBulk Restriction Checker\nSeller Spy\nBrand Analyzer\nFREE TOOLS\nASIN Lookup\nIP-Alert Lookup\nSupplier Finder\nASIN to UPC\nUPC to ASIN\nEAN to ASIN\nFEATURES\nFBM & FBA Calculator\nVAT Calculator\nAmazon IP-Alert\nSide Panel View\nAmazon Quick View\nStorefront Widget\nAlerts & Flags\nRestrictions Checker\nSales Estimator\nOffers\nVariation Viewer\nStock Checker\nASIN Grabber\nSub-Accounts for VAs\nExport to Google Sheets\nNotes\nALTERNATIVES\nAnalyzer.Tools Alternative\nScan Unlimited Alternative\nSmartScout Alternative\nRevSeller Alternative\nBuyBotPro Alternative\nAZInsight Alternative\nSellerAmp Alternative\nIP-Alert Alternative\nDS Quick View Alternative\nPARTNERS\nAffiliate Program\nPartners\nAmazon Experts\nPress Kit\nRESOURCES\nBlog\nGet a Demo\nHelp Center\nOffice Hours\nNews & Updates\nProduct Roadmap\nReviews\nINTEGRATIONS\nZapier\nMake\nAirtable\nn8n\nGoogle Sheets\nSeller Central\nPrep Centers\nAPI\nOTHER LINKS\nIP-Alert by Seller Assistant\nLANGUAGE\n🇬🇧 English\n🇷🇺 Русский\n🇪🇸 Español\n🇹🇷 Türkçe\n\nCopyright © 2019-2026 Linen Art, LLC. All rights reserved.\nAmazon and all related marks are trademarks of Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates.\n\nTerms of Use\n|\nPrivacy Policy\n|\nCookie Policy\n|\nRefund Policy"
